			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n- PREGEN: new feature which allows users to pregenerate chunks from world spawn for a given radius. Safely rejects anything too big. (fd9cd188)\n- bluemap: make marker popup links clickable and give the youtube marker a real button (323d84c6)\n- skills: claim and spawn checks on every direct block change, Enemy-wide combat XP, all harvestable crops and berries for farming, a Master Angler window that outlives the cast, edge-triggered Dash, and held-item cooldown hints (f0576118)\n- shops: sell the actual chest stack so enchantments, firework durations and every other component survive (84e75ae1)\n- skills: Tree Feller reaches the whole tree and no longer skip claim check (3c5a0108)\n-  backups: public download saves the snapshot under its real name, plus fabric-api declared required on the Fabric release (8e53d7d4)\n- readme readability pass (45172d08)\n- youtube link (85255f93)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Rvhoyos/QuackedSMP/compare/v2.3.0...v2.3.2"
